  "description": "This is a custom-designed balisong, commonly known as a butterfly knife. The defining characteristic of this weapon is the fan-like opening of a freely pivoting blade, allowing rapid deployment or concealment. As a result, butterfly knives are outlawed in many countries. It has individual parts spray-painted solid colors in a night ops color scheme.\\n\\n<i>It's the whisper of the wind... it's the bite at your neck</i>",
